TEXT 752 -240 Left 2 ;These circuits demonstrate the effects of a resistor on a tank circuit.\nThe logic is simple, if we add a resistor in series with C then C\ncan be smaller, making the f go up, and vice versa\nThis logic can be applied to series L-C/parallel resistor sets
